# MEMS API – manual tests (Visual Studio / VS Code REST Client).
# Start the solution through MEMS.AppHost first. The API listens on https://localhost:7045.
# Full interactive documentation: https://localhost:7045/swagger

@api = https://localhost:7045

### ---------- Public reads (no token) ----------

### Tenant directory
GET {{api}}/api/municipalities

### One tenant's public profile
GET {{api}}/api/burnaby

### Burnaby positions
GET {{api}}/api/burnaby/positions

### Burnaby candidates: name search, position filter, paging
GET {{api}}/api/burnaby/candidates?search=zhao&page=1&pageSize=9

### Unknown tenant -> 404 ProblemDetails
GET {{api}}/api/nowhere/candidates

### A Surrey candidate requested through the Burnaby URL -> 404 (tenant isolation)
GET {{api}}/api/burnaby/candidates/15

### ---------- Sign in ----------

# @name burnabyLogin
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "burnabyadmin", "password": "P@$$w0rd" }

###
@burnabyToken = {{burnabyLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

# @name superLogin
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "super", "password": "P@$$w0rd" }

###
@superToken = {{superLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Wrong password -> 401 (same message as an unknown user)
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "burnabyadmin", "password": "wrong" }

### ---------- Writes as a Municipality Administrator ----------

### Create a position in the administrator's own tenant -> 201
POST {{api}}/api/burnaby/positions
Authorization: Bearer {{burnabyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Park Board Commissioner", "seatsAvailable": 3 }

### Write to another tenant -> 403 (enforced by the API, not the UI)
POST {{api}}/api/surrey/positions
Authorization: Bearer {{burnabyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Not allowed", "seatsAvailable": 1 }

### Invalid body -> 400 with field errors
POST {{api}}/api/burnaby/candidates
Authorization: Bearer {{burnabyToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "A", "email": "not-an-email", "website": "javascript:alert(1)", "positionId": 1 }

### Anonymous write -> 401
DELETE {{api}}/api/burnaby/candidates/1

### Municipality Administrators cannot delete tenants -> 403
DELETE {{api}}/api/municipalities/2
Authorization: Bearer {{burnabyToken}}

### ---------- Writes as a Super Admin ----------

### Create a tenant -> 201
POST {{api}}/api/municipalities
Authorization: Bearer {{superToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Coquitlam",
  "slug": "coquitlam",
  "province": "British Columbia",
  "electionDate": "2026-10-17",
  "tagline": "Where trails meet the city.",
  "themeColor": "#9a3412"
}

### Reserved or duplicate slug -> 400 / 409
POST {{api}}/api/municipalities
Authorization: Bearer {{superToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Another Burnaby", "slug": "burnaby", "province": "British Columbia", "electionDate": "2026-10-17", "themeColor": "#112233" }
